": "私があなたのところへ行きます。 クソ警官どもめ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2679.618, "timestamp": "00:44:39", "text": "ペイントボールがそうでない理由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2681.012, "timestamp": "00:44:41", "text": "適切な？そうするべきです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2682.028, "timestamp": "00:44:42", "text": "撃つ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2683.09, "timestamp": "00:44:43", "text": "私は取らなければならなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2683.668, "timestamp": "00:44:43", "text": "ショットガン。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.292, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "これ…私は今まさにこの状況にいる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2689.762, "timestamp": "00:44:49", "text": "場所。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2691.35, "timestamp": "00:44:51", "text": "あ、こんにちは。どこ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2692.598, "timestamp": "00:44:52", "text": "容疑者？あなたも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2693.662, "timestamp": "00:44:53", "text": "彼に着せる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2694.281, "timestamp": "00:44:54", "text": "手錠？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2695.914, "timestamp": "00:44:55", "text": "はい、彼はここにいます。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2699.41, "timestamp": "00:44:59", "text": "ああ、彼がここにいる。良い。何てことだ"}]